## Key API Patterns You've Just Learned

| Pattern | What It Does | Example |
|---------|--------------|---------|
| `AddCryptoFuture()` | Subscribe to a symbol | `AddCryptoFuture("BTCUSDT", Resolution.Daily, Market.Binance)` |
| `SMA()` helper | Create & register an indicator | `_sma = SMA("BTCUSDT", 50, Resolution.Daily)` |
| `SetWarmUp()` | Prime indicators with history | `SetWarmUp(50, Resolution.Daily)` |
| `IsWarmingUp` guard | Skip trades during primer phase | `if (IsWarmingUp) return;` |
| `data.ContainsKey()` | Check data availability | `if (!data.ContainsKey("BTCUSDT")) return;` |
| `_indicator.IsReady` | Check indicator validity | `if (!_sma.IsReady) return;` |
| `SetHoldings()` | Position sizing | `SetHoldings("BTCUSDT", 1.0m)` (100% long) |
| `Liquidate()` | Close position | `Liquidate("BTCUSDT")` |
| `Portfolio[]` | Check current position state | `Portfolio["BTCUSDT"].IsLong` |

