## Common Next Steps to Customize Your Strategy

### 1. **Add a Secondary Filter** (e.g., RSI overbought/oversold)

You could modify the signal to only trade when:
- Price > SMA (trend) **AND** RSI < 70 (not overbought)

```csharp
private RelativeStrengthIndex _rsi;

public override void Initialize()
{
    _sma = SMA("BTCUSDT", 50, Resolution.Daily);
    _rsi = RSI("BTCUSDT", 14, MovingAverageType.Wilders, Resolution.Daily);
    SetWarmUp(50, Resolution.Daily);  // Covers both indicators
}

public override void OnData(Slice data)
{
    if (IsWarmingUp || !data.ContainsKey("BTCUSDT") || !_sma.IsReady || !_rsi.IsReady)
        return;

    var price = data["BTCUSDT"].Close;
    var smaValue = _sma.Current.Value;
    var rsiValue = _rsi.Current.Value;

    // Only go long if price > SMA AND RSI is not extreme
    if (price > smaValue && rsiValue < 70 && !Portfolio["BTCUSDT"].IsLong)
    {
        SetHoldings("BTCUSDT", 1.0m);
    }
    else if (price < smaValue && Portfolio["BTCUSDT"].IsLong)
    {
        Liquidate("BTCUSDT");
    }
}
```

### 2. **Add a Stop-Loss**

Exit if you drop 5% below entry:

```csharp
private decimal _entryPrice;

public override void OnData(Slice data)
{
    // ... existing guards ...

    var price = data["BTCUSDT"].Close;
    var position = Portfolio["BTCUSDT"];

    if (price > smaValue && !position.IsLong)
    {
        SetHoldings("BTCUSDT", 1.0m);
        _entryPrice = price;
    }
    else if (position.IsLong)
    {
        // Check stop-loss: exit if down 5%
        if (price < _entryPrice * 0.95m)
        {
            Liquidate("BTCUSDT");
            Log($"Stop-loss hit at {price}");
        }
        // Or exit on trend reversal
        else if (price < smaValue)
        {
            Liquidate("BTCUSDT");
        }
    }
}
```

### 3. **Trade Multiple Timeframes**

If you want daily trend on a 4-hour chart, use consolidators:

```csharp
private TradeBarConsolidator _dailyConsolidator;
private SimpleMovingAverage _smaDailyOnHourly;

public override void Initialize()
{
    AddCryptoFuture("BTCUSDT", Resolution.Hour, Market.Binance);  // Subscribe to hourly

    // Create a consolidator that combines hourly bars into daily
    _dailyConsolidator = new TradeBarConsolidator(TimeSpan.FromHours(24));
    SubscriptionManager.AddConsolidator("BTCUSDT", _dailyConsolidator);

    // Register an indicator on the daily consolidator
    _smaDailyOnHourly = new SimpleMovingAverage(50);
    RegisterIndicator("BTCUSDT", _smaDailyOnHourly, _dailyConsolidator);
}
```

